{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib, Uncle of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.)",
  "data": "With the Four Imams (a.s.)\nAt the grave of Abbas in al-Baqi, where the four Imams (a.s.) are buried beside him, recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَنَا يَا عَبَّاسُ يَا عَمَّ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAYYIDANAA YAA A'BBAASU YAA A'MMA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O our master, O Abbas, O uncle of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمَّ نَبِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'MMA NABIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O uncle of the Prophet of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمَّ حَبِيْبِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'MMA HABEEBILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O uncle of the beloved of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمَّ الْمُصْطَفٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'MMAL MUSTAFAA\nPeace be upon you, O uncle of the Chosen One.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَنَا الْاِمَامَ الْحَسَنَ الْمُجْتَبٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAYYIDANAL IMAAMAL HASANAL MUJTABAA\nPeace be upon you, O our master, Imam al-Hasan al-Mujtaba.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَنَا الْاِمَامَ زَيْنَ الْعَابِدِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAYYIDANAL IMAAMA ZAYNAL A'ABIDEEN\nPeace be upon you, O our master, Imam Zayn al-Abidin.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَنَا الْاِمَامَ مُحَمَّدًا الْبَاقِرَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAYYIDANAL IMAAMA MUHAMMADANIL BAAQIR\nPeace be upon you, O our master, Imam Muhammad al-Baqir.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَنَا الْاِمَامَ جَعْفَرًا الصَّادِقَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAYYIDANAL IMAAMA JA'FARANIS SAADIQ\nPeace be upon you, O our master, Imam Ja'far al-Sadiq.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَهْلَ بَيْتِ النُّبُوَّةِ وَمَعْدِنَ الرِّسَالَةِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM YAA AHLA BAYTIN NUBUWWATI WA MA'DINAR RISAALAH\nPeace be upon you, O Household of Prophethood and source of the Message.\nرَضِيَ اللّٰهُ عَنْكُمْ وَاَرْضَاكُمْ اَحْسَنَ الرِّضَا\nRADIYALLAAHU A'NKUM WA ARDAAKUM AHSANAR RIDAA\nMay Allah be pleased with you and make you pleased in the best way,\nوَجَعَلَ الْجَنَّةَ مَثْوَاكُمْ وَمَسْكَنَكُمْ وَمَحَلَّكُمْ وَمَاْوَاكُمْ\nWA JA'ALAL JANNATA MATHWAAKUM WA MASKANAKUM WA MAHALLAKUM WA MA'WAAKUM\nand make Paradise your resting place, your home, your station and your shelter.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace be upon you, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings.",
  "tabs": [
    "Short Form\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَبَّاسُ بْنَ عَبْدِ الْمُطَّلِبِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'BBAASUBNA A'BDIL MUTTALIB\nPeace be upon you, O Abbas, son of Abd al-Muttalib.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمَّ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA A'MMA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O uncle of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ السِّقَايَةِ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA SAAHIBAS SIQAAYATI WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace be upon you, O keeper of the pilgrims' water, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings."
  ],
  "merits": "Abbas, son of Abd al-Muttalib, was the uncle of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) and of Amir al-Mu'minin (a.s.), and the father of Abdullah ibn Abbas. He held the Siqayah, the duty of giving water to the pilgrims at Makkah, before Islam and after it. He died in Madinah in 32 AH and was buried in al-Baqi; Imam al-Hasan, Imam Zayn al-Abidin, Imam al-Baqir and Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.) were later buried beside him, under one dome until 1926, which is why the longer form greets them too. Al-Shahid al-Awwal counts visiting him among the recommended ziyarats (al-Durus al-Shar'iyyah).\n\nBoth forms are given in Shia pilgrims' guides to al-Baqi without a narrated source."
}
